<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%=guild.name%> | Killora</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css"></head><body>
<nav><button id="menuToggle" class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Open feature menu">☰</button><b>KILLORA<span>_BOT</span></b><div><a href="/dashboard">← Servers</a>　<a href="/logout">Logout</a></div></nav><aside id="featureMenu" class="feature-menu"><div class="menu-head">KILLORA MODULES <button id="menuClose" type="button">×</button></div><a href="#welcome">Welcome Message</a><a href="#leave">Leave Message</a><a href="#boost">Booster Messages</a><a href="#sticky">Sticky Messages</a><a href="#sender">Message Sender</a><a href="#autoresponder">Autoresponder</a><a href="#invites">Invite Tracker</a><a href="#music">Music Player</a><a href="#tickets">Ticket System</a><a href="#ai">Gemini AI</a><a href="#voice">Join 2 Create</a><a href="#staff">Staff Applications</a><a href="#security">Security</a><a href="#plugins">Plugin Manager</a><a href="#backup">Backup / Restore</a><a href="#embed">Embed Builder</a><a href="#saved-panels">Saved Ticket Panels</a></aside><div id="menuShade" class="menu-shade"></div><main class="wrap"><div class="tag">SERVER CONFIGURATION</div><h1><%=guild.name%></h1><% if(new URLSearchParams((typeof location!=='undefined'?location.search:'' )).get('saved')){} %><div class="grid two"><section class="card" id="welcome"><h2>Welcome Message</h2><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/welcome"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.welcome?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable welcome</label><label>Channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea name="content"><%=cfg.welcome?.content||'Welcome {user} to {server}! You are member #{memberCount}.'%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="useEmbed" <%=cfg.welcome?.useEmbed?'checked':''%>> Send as embed</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" maxlength="256" value="<%=cfg.welcome?.embedTitle||'Welcome to {server}!'%>"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription"><%=cfg.welcome?.embedDescription||'Welcome {user}! You are member #{memberCount}.'%></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%=cfg.welcome?.embedColor||'#39ff14'%>"></label><details class="variables"><summary>All available variables · tap to expand</summary><p><b>User:</b> <code>{user}</code> <code>{mention}</code> <code>{userMention}</code> <code>{username}</code> <code>{displayName}</code> <code>{globalName}</code> <code>{userid}</code> <code>{userId}</code> <code>{usertag}</code> <code>{discriminator}</code> <code>{userAvatar}</code> <code>{userAvatarURL}</code> <code>{memberAvatar}</code> <code>{serverAvatar}</code> <code>{userCreatedAt}</code> <code>{userCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{accountAge}</code> <code>{joinedAt}</code> <code>{joinedTimestamp}</code> <code>{joinDate}</code> <code>{joinTime}</code> <code>{memberCountOrdinal}</code></p><p><b>Server:</b> <code>{server}</code> <code>{serverName}</code> <code>{guildName}</code> <code>{serverId}</code> <code>{guildId}</code> <code>{memberCount}</code> <code>{guildMemberCount}</code> <code>{serverIcon}</code> <code>{serverIconURL}</code> <code>{serverOwner}</code> <code>{serverOwnerId}</code> <code>{serverCreatedAt}</code> <code>{serverCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{serverBoostCount}</code> <code>{serverBoostLevel}</code> <code>{timestamp}</code> <code>{unix}</code> <code>{date}</code> <code>{time}</code></p><p><b>Channel / message:</b> <code>{channel}</code> <code>{channelName}</code> <code>{channelId}</code> <code>{channelMention}</code> <code>{message}</code> <code>{messageId}</code> <code>{bot}</code> <code>{botName}</code> <code>{botId}</code></p><p><b>Invite tracker:</b> <code>{inviter}</code> <code>{inviterName}</code> <code>{inviterId}</code> <code>{inviteCode}</code> <code>{inviteUses}</code></p><p><b>Legacy aliases:</b> <code>${userid}</code> <code>${username}</code> <code>${usertag}</code> <code>${usermention}</code> <code>${useravatarurl}</code> <code>${userserveravatarurl}</code> <code>${guildmembercount}</code> <code>${guildname}</code> <code>${guildid}</code> <code>${channelname}</code></p><p class="muted">In embed titles/descriptions, {user} and {mention} show the member's display name because Discord does not render mentions inside embeds. In normal message text, they create a real clickable mention.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary copy-all-vars">Copy all variables</button></details><div class="discord-preview" data-preview="welcome"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div></div></div><button class="btn">Save welcome settings</button></form></section><section class="card" id="tickets"><h2>Ticket Panel Builder</h2><p>Create your own ticket categories and buttons. No fixed button list.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/tickets" id="ticketForm"><label>Panel name<input name="name" value="Support Panel" required></label><label>Send panel to<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><label>Embed title<input name="title" value="🎫 Support Center"></label><label>Description<textarea name="description">Choose the option that best matches your request.</textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="color" value="#39ff14"></label><h3>Buttons</h3><div id="buttons"></div><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="addButton">+ Add ticket option</button><h3>Dropdown options (each option gets its own category)</h3><label>Dropdown placeholder<input name="selectPlaceholder" maxlength="150" value="Choose a ticket category"></label><div id="selectOptions"></div><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="addSelectOption">+ Add dropdown option</button><div class="discord-preview" data-preview="ticket"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-embed"><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div><div class="preview-buttons"></div></div></div><button class="btn">Save ticket panel</button></form></section></div>
<section class="card" id="autoresponder"><h2>⚡ Advanced Autoresponder</h2><p>One reply can contain normal text, an embed and an image together. Upload a QR image or provide an image URL.</p><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/autoresponders"><fieldset class="trigger-config"><legend>⚡ AUTORESPONDER TRIGGER — REQUIRED</legend><p class="muted">Yahan trigger set karo. User ka message is rule se match hoga tabhi reply send hoga.</p><label>1. Trigger keyword / phrase<input name="trigger" type="text" placeholder="Example: qr, payment, support" maxlength="100" required autocomplete="off"></label><label>2. How should the message match?<select name="matchType" required><option value="contains" selected>Contains — message ke andar keyword ho</option><option value="exact">Exact match — message bilkul same ho</option><option value="startsWith">Starts with — message keyword se shuru ho</option><option value="endsWith">Ends with — message keyword par khatam ho</option></select></label><label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" name="caseSensitive"> Case-sensitive matching</label></fieldset><label>Text message<textarea name="response" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Payment ke liye QR scan karein, {user}."></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="embedEnabled"> Also send an embed in the same message</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" maxlength="256" placeholder="Payment details"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Payment instructions..."></textarea></label><div class="grid two"><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="#39ff14"></label><label>Embed image URL (optional)<input name="embedImage" type="url" placeholder="https://.../image.png"></label></div><label>Upload image / QR (PNG, JPG, GIF, WEBP · max 5 MB)<input name="imageFile" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp"></label><label>Or image URL (optional)<input name="imageUrl" type="url" placeholder="https://.../qr.png"></label><div class="grid two"><label>Only in channel (optional)<select name="channelId" class="channel-select"><option value="">All channels</option></select></label><label>Required role (optional)<select name="roleId" class="role-select"><option value="">Everyone</option></select></label></div><div class="grid two"><label>Cooldown seconds<input type="number" name="cooldownSeconds" min="0" max="3600" value="0"></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="caseSensitive"> Case-sensitive trigger</label></div><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" checked> Enable this autoresponder</label><details class="variables"><summary>All available variables · tap to expand</summary><p><b>User:</b> <code>{user}</code> <code>{mention}</code> <code>{userMention}</code> <code>{username}</code> <code>{displayName}</code> <code>{globalName}</code> <code>{userid}</code> <code>{userId}</code> <code>{usertag}</code> <code>{discriminator}</code> <code>{userAvatar}</code> <code>{userAvatarURL}</code> <code>{memberAvatar}</code> <code>{serverAvatar}</code> <code>{userCreatedAt}</code> <code>{userCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{accountAge}</code> <code>{joinedAt}</code> <code>{joinedTimestamp}</code> <code>{joinDate}</code> <code>{joinTime}</code> <code>{memberCountOrdinal}</code></p><p><b>Server:</b> <code>{server}</code> <code>{serverName}</code> <code>{guildName}</code> <code>{serverId}</code> <code>{guildId}</code> <code>{memberCount}</code> <code>{guildMemberCount}</code> <code>{serverIcon}</code> <code>{serverIconURL}</code> <code>{serverOwner}</code> <code>{serverOwnerId}</code> <code>{serverCreatedAt}</code> <code>{serverCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{serverBoostCount}</code> <code>{serverBoostLevel}</code> <code>{timestamp}</code> <code>{unix}</code> <code>{date}</code> <code>{time}</code></p><p><b>Channel / message:</b> <code>{channel}</code> <code>{channelName}</code> <code>{channelId}</code> <code>{channelMention}</code> <code>{message}</code> <code>{messageId}</code> <code>{bot}</code> <code>{botName}</code> <code>{botId}</code></p><p><b>Invite tracker:</b> <code>{inviter}</code> <code>{inviterName}</code> <code>{inviterId}</code> <code>{inviteCode}</code> <code>{inviteUses}</code></p><p><b>Legacy aliases:</b> <code>${userid}</code> <code>${username}</code> <code>${usertag}</code> <code>${usermention}</code> <code>${useravatarurl}</code> <code>${userserveravatarurl}</code> <code>${guildmembercount}</code> <code>${guildname}</code> <code>${guildid}</code> <code>${channelname}</code></p><p class="muted">In embed titles/descriptions, {user} and {mention} show the member's display name because Discord does not render mentions inside embeds. In normal message text, they create a real clickable mention.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary copy-all-vars">Copy all variables</button></details><div class="discord-preview" data-preview="autoresponder"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small><img class="preview-image" hidden style="display:block;max-width:100%;max-height:220px;margin-top:8px;border-radius:8px"></div></div></div><button class="btn">+ Add autoresponder</button></form><h3>📚 Saved Autoresponder List (<%= (cfg.autoresponders||[]).length %>)</h3><p class="muted">Each saved rule appears here. Set its trigger above, choose how it matches, and add as many rules as needed.</p><% (cfg.autoresponders||[]).forEach((a,i)=>{ %><div class="saved"><b>#<%=i+1%> · <%=a.trigger%></b> · <%=a.matchType||'contains'%> · <%=a.enabled===false?'Disabled':'Enabled'%><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/autoresponders/<%=i%>/delete" style="display:inline"><button class="btn danger" type="submit">Delete</button></form><p><%=a.response||'(No text)'%></p><% if(a.imageUrl){ %><small>Image: <%=a.imageUrl%></small><% } %></div><% }) %></section>
<section class="card" id="music"><h2>🎵 Killora Native Music Engine</h2><p>All music playback runs inside Killora Bot. No Lavalink URL, server, host, port or password required.</p><div class="saved"><b>Engine:</b> yt-dlp stream resolver + FFmpeg + Discord Voice · <b>Queue limit:</b> configurable</div><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/music"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.music?.enabled!==false?'checked':''%>> Enable music module</label><label>Default voice channel<select name="voiceChannelId" id="musicVoiceChannel" class="voice-select"><option value="">Let member choose their voice channel</option></select></label><label>Default music text channel<select name="textChannelId" id="musicTextChannel" class="channel-select"><option value="">Use command channel</option></select></label><label>DJ role<select name="djRoleId" id="musicDjRole" class="role-select"><option value="">No DJ role restriction</option></select></label><div class="grid two"><label>Queue limit<input type="number" name="queueLimit" min="1" max="500" value="<%=cfg.music?.queueLimit||100%>"></label><label>Default volume (%)<input type="number" name="defaultVolume" min="0" max="200" value="<%=cfg.music?.defaultVolume??80%>"></label></div><label><input type="checkbox" name="allowExternalUrls" <%=cfg.music?.allowExternalUrls!==false?'checked':''%>> Allow supported external audio/video URLs</label><button class="btn">Save music settings</button></form><p class="muted">Commands: /play, /pause, /resume, /skip, /stop, /queue, /loop, /volume, /shuffle, /nowplaying. Use Discord voice permissions: Connect, Speak and Use Voice Activity.</p></section><div class="grid two"><section class="card" id="ai"><h2>🤖 Gemini AI</h2><p>Use your Gemini API key from the server .env file. The key is never sent to the browser.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/ai"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.ai?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable mention-based AI replies</label><label>AI reply channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select"><option value="">Select channel</option></select></label><label>System instructions<textarea name="systemPrompt"><%=cfg.ai?.systemPrompt||'You are Killora Bot AI, a friendly and helpful Discord server assistant. Keep replies concise.'%></textarea></label><button class="btn">Save AI settings</button></form><p class="muted">Members can mention the bot in the selected channel to ask Gemini.</p></section><section class="card" id="voice"><h2>🔊 Join to Create</h2><p>Members join one voice channel and receive their own temporary room.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/join-to-create"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.joinToCreate?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable Join to Create</label><label>Trigger voice channel<select name="channelId" class="voice-select"><option value="">Select voice channel</option></select></label><label>New room category<select name="categoryId" class="category-select"><option value="">No category</option></select></label><button class="btn">Save voice settings</button></form></section></div><div class="grid two"><section class="card" id="staff"><h2>🧑‍💼 Staff Applications</h2><p>Select destinations from Discord resources; IDs are not typed manually.</p><form id="staffForm"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.staffApply?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable staff applications</label><label>Applications channel<select name="applyChannelId" class="channel-select"></select></label><label>Approved channel<select name="approvedChannelId" class="channel-select"></select></label><label>Denied channel<select name="deniedChannelId" class="channel-select"></select></label><label>Application category<select name="categoryId" class="category-select"></select></label><label>DM Questions (one question per line, up to 12)<textarea name="questions" rows="7" placeholder="Why do you want to join our staff team?&#10;How much time can you contribute?&#10;Do you have previous moderation experience?"><%= (cfg.staffApply?.questions||[]).join('\n') %></textarea></label><p class="muted">Members use /apply. The bot asks these questions one by one in DMs, then sends the application to the pending channel.</p><button class="btn" type="submit">Save staff settings</button></form></section><section class="card" id="security"><h2>🛡️ Anti-Nuke Protection</h2><form id="securityForm"><% ['antiWebhook','antiChannelDelete','antiRoleDelete','antiMassBan','antiMassKick','antiBotJoin'].forEach(k=>{ %><label><input type="checkbox" name="<%=k%>" <%=cfg.security?.[k]?'checked':''%>> <%=k.replace('anti','Anti ')%></label><% }) %><button class="btn" type="submit">Save protection settings</button></form><p class="muted">Uses Discord audit logs. Ensure the bot has View Audit Log and moderation permissions.</p></section></div><div class="grid two"><section class="card" id="plugins"><h2>🧩 Plugin Manager</h2><p>Only install trusted plugins that you control. Plugins execute server-side code.</p><div id="pluginList">Loading plugins…</div></section><section class="card" id="backup"><h2>💾 Configuration Backup</h2><p>Exports Killora Bot bot settings for this server. This is not a full Discord server backup.</p><a class="btn" href="/api/guild/<%=guild.id%>/backup">Download JSON backup</a></section></div><section class="card" id="embed"><h2>🧱 Embed Preview</h2><label>Title<input id="embedTitle" maxlength="256"></label><label>Description<textarea id="embedDescription" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label><label>Color<input id="embedColor" type="color" value="#39ff14"></label><button class="btn" id="previewEmbed" type="button">Preview embed JSON</button><pre id="embedOutput"></pre></section><section class="card" id="saved-panels"><h2>Saved Ticket Panels</h2><p>Edit panel details and every individual dropdown/button option below. Saving updates the existing Discord panel message in place.</p><% (cfg.ticketPanels||[]).forEach((p,i)=>{ %><details class="saved"><summary><b><%=p.name%></b> — <%= (p.selectOptions||[]).length %> dropdown options · <code><%=p.channelId%></code></summary><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/tickets/<%=i%>/edit"><input type="hidden" name="editSelectOptions" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="editButtons" value="1"><label>Panel name<input name="name" value="<%=p.name%>" required></label><label>Panel channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" data-selected="<%=p.channelId%>" required><option value="<%=p.channelId%>">Current channel</option></select></label><label>Embed title<input name="title" value="<%=p.title%>"></label><label>Description<textarea name="description"><%=p.description%></textarea></label><label>Color<input type="color" name="color" value="<%=p.color||'#39ff14'%>"></label><label>Dropdown placeholder<input name="selectPlaceholder" value="<%=p.selectPlaceholder||'Choose a ticket category'%>"></label><h3>✏️ Edit Dropdown Options</h3><% (p.selectOptions||[]).forEach((o,j)=>{ %><div class="button-editor"><b>Dropdown option #<%=j+1%></b><input type="hidden" name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][id]" value="<%=o.id%>"><label>Option label<input name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][label]" maxlength="100" value="<%=o.label%>" required></label><label>Description<input name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][description]" maxlength="100" value="<%=o.description||''%>"></label><label>Emoji<input name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][emoji]" value="<%=o.emoji||''%>"></label><label>Ticket category<select class="category-select" name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][categoryId]" data-selected="<%=o.categoryId||''%>"><option value="">No category</option></select></label><label>Support staff role<select class="role-select" name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][staffRoleId]" data-selected="<%=o.staffRoleId||''%>"><option value="">No staff role</option></select></label><label>Opening message<textarea name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][welcomeMessage]"><%=o.welcomeMessage||''%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][enabled]" value="1" <%=o.enabled===false?'':'checked'%>> Enable this option</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="selectOptions[<%=j%>][remove]" value="1"> Delete this dropdown option</label></div><% }) %><h3>✏️ Edit Button Options</h3><% (p.buttons||[]).forEach((o,j)=>{ %><div class="button-editor"><b>Button option #<%=j+1%></b><input type="hidden" name="buttons[<%=j%>][id]" value="<%=o.id%>"><label>Button label<input name="buttons[<%=j%>][label]" maxlength="80" value="<%=o.label%>" required></label><label>Emoji<input name="buttons[<%=j%>][emoji]" value="<%=o.emoji||''%>"></label><label>Button color<select name="buttons[<%=j%>][style]"><option value="3" <%=Number(o.style)===3?'selected':''%>>Green</option><option value="1" <%=Number(o.style)===1?'selected':''%>>Blue</option><option value="2" <%=Number(o.style)===2?'selected':''%>>Grey</option><option value="4" <%=Number(o.style)===4?'selected':''%>>Red</option></select></label><label>Ticket category<select class="category-select" name="buttons[<%=j%>][categoryId]" data-selected="<%=o.categoryId||''%>"><option value="">No category</option></select></label><label>Support staff role<select class="role-select" name="buttons[<%=j%>][staffRoleId]" data-selected="<%=o.staffRoleId||''%>"><option value="">No staff role</option></select></label><label>Opening message<textarea name="buttons[<%=j%>][welcomeMessage]"><%=o.welcomeMessage||''%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="buttons[<%=j%>][remove]" value="1"> Delete this button option</label></div><% }) %><button class="btn">Save all panel and option changes</button></form><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/tickets/<%=i%>/delete" onsubmit="return confirm('Delete this saved panel and its Discord message?')"><button class="btn danger">Delete panel</button></form></details><% }) %><% if(!(cfg.ticketPanels||[]).length){ %><p>No panels created yet.</p><% } %><h3>Transcript Settings</h3><p>Closed ticket HTML transcripts are uploaded here before the ticket channel is deleted.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/ticket-transcripts"><label>Transcript log channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" data-selected="<%=cfg.ticketTranscriptChannelId||cfg.logsChannelId||''%>"><option value="">Select transcript channel</option></select></label><button class="btn">Save transcript channel</button></form></section><section class="grid two"><section class="card" id="leave"><h2>👋 Leave Message</h2><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/leave"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.leave?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable leave messages</label><label>Channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea name="content"><%=cfg.leave?.content||'{username} left {server}.'%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="useEmbed" <%=cfg.leave?.useEmbed?'checked':''%>> Send as embed</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" value="<%=cfg.leave?.embedTitle||'Goodbye!'%>"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription"><%=cfg.leave?.embedDescription||''%></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%=cfg.leave?.embedColor||'#ff5555'%>"></label><div class="discord-preview" data-preview="leave"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div></div></div><button class="btn">Save leave settings</button></form></section><section class="card" id="boost"><h2>💎 Booster Messages</h2><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/boost"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.boost?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable boost messages</label><label>Channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><label>Boost message<textarea name="content"><%=cfg.boost?.content||'💎 {user} boosted {server}!'%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="removeEnabled" <%=cfg.boost?.removeEnabled?'checked':''%>> Enable boost-ended message</label><label>Boost ended text<textarea name="removeContent"><%=cfg.boost?.removeContent||'A boost from {username} ended.'%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="useEmbed" <%=cfg.boost?.useEmbed?'checked':''%>> Send as embed</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" value="<%=cfg.boost?.embedTitle||'New Server Boost!'%>"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription"><%=cfg.boost?.embedDescription||''%></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%=cfg.boost?.embedColor||'#ff73fa'%>"></label><div class="discord-preview" data-preview="boost"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW · BOOST</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div></div><div class="preview-label" style="margin-top:12px">BOOST ENDED PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message" data-boost-ended><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div></div></div><button class="btn">Save boost settings</button></form></section></section><section class="card" id="invites"><h2>🎟️ Invite Tracker Message</h2><p>Customize the join message. The bot detects which invite was used and mentions the inviter when Discord provides that information. Make sure the bot has Manage Server / View Invites permission.</p><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/invites"><label><input type="checkbox" name="enabled" <%=cfg.inviteMessage?.enabled?'checked':''%>> Enable invite join messages</label><label>Message channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select"><option value="">Select channel</option></select></label><label>Message text<textarea name="content" maxlength="1900"><%=cfg.inviteMessage?.content||'🎉 {user} joined! Invited by {inviter}.'%></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="useEmbed" <%=cfg.inviteMessage?.useEmbed?'checked':''%>> Send as embed</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" maxlength="256" value="<%=cfg.inviteMessage?.embedTitle||'New member joined!'%>"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription" maxlength="4000"><%=cfg.inviteMessage?.embedDescription||''%></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="<%=cfg.inviteMessage?.embedColor||'#39ff14'%>"></label><details class="variables" open><summary>Invite variables (tap to copy)</summary><p><code>{user}</code> joining member mention · <code>{username}</code> name · <code>{userid}</code> ID · <code>{inviter}</code> inviter mention · <code>{inviterName}</code> inviter name · <code>{inviterId}</code> inviter ID · <code>{inviteCode}</code> invite code · <code>{inviteUses}</code> invite uses · <code>{server}</code> server name · <code>{serverId}</code> server ID · <code>{memberCount}</code> member count · <code>{joinedAt}</code> join date</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('{user} {username} {userid} {inviter} {inviterName} {inviterId} {inviteCode} {inviteUses} {server} {serverId} {memberCount} {joinedAt}')">Copy all variables</button></details><button class="btn">Save invite tracker</button></form></section><section class="grid two"><section class="card" id="sticky"><h2>📌 Sticky Message</h2><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/sticky"><label>Channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><fieldset class="trigger-config"><legend>📌 STICKY MESSAGE TRIGGER</legend><p class="muted">Choose exactly when this sticky message should be reposted in the selected channel.</p><label>1. Trigger type<select name="matchType" class="sticky-match-type"><option value="everyMessage">Every message — normal sticky mode</option><option value="contains">Contains keyword</option><option value="exact">Exact message match</option><option value="startsWith">Starts with keyword</option><option value="endsWith">Ends with keyword</option></select></label><label>2. Trigger keyword<input name="trigger" class="sticky-trigger" maxlength="100" placeholder="Example: rules (required for keyword triggers)" disabled></label><label class="inline-check"><input type="checkbox" name="caseSensitive"> Case-sensitive matching</label></fieldset><label>Message text<textarea name="content" placeholder="Rules reminder..." required></textarea></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="useEmbed"> Send as embed</label><label>Embed title<input name="embedTitle" maxlength="256" placeholder="Server Rules"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="embedDescription" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Please follow the rules..."></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="embedColor" value="#39ff14"></label><details class="variables"><summary>All available variables · tap to expand</summary><p><b>User:</b> <code>{user}</code> <code>{mention}</code> <code>{userMention}</code> <code>{username}</code> <code>{displayName}</code> <code>{globalName}</code> <code>{userid}</code> <code>{userId}</code> <code>{usertag}</code> <code>{discriminator}</code> <code>{userAvatar}</code> <code>{userAvatarURL}</code> <code>{memberAvatar}</code> <code>{serverAvatar}</code> <code>{userCreatedAt}</code> <code>{userCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{accountAge}</code> <code>{joinedAt}</code> <code>{joinedTimestamp}</code> <code>{joinDate}</code> <code>{joinTime}</code> <code>{memberCountOrdinal}</code></p><p><b>Server:</b> <code>{server}</code> <code>{serverName}</code> <code>{guildName}</code> <code>{serverId}</code> <code>{guildId}</code> <code>{memberCount}</code> <code>{guildMemberCount}</code> <code>{serverIcon}</code> <code>{serverIconURL}</code> <code>{serverOwner}</code> <code>{serverOwnerId}</code> <code>{serverCreatedAt}</code> <code>{serverCreatedTimestamp}</code> <code>{serverBoostCount}</code> <code>{serverBoostLevel}</code> <code>{timestamp}</code> <code>{unix}</code> <code>{date}</code> <code>{time}</code></p><p><b>Channel / message:</b> <code>{channel}</code> <code>{channelName}</code> <code>{channelId}</code> <code>{channelMention}</code> <code>{message}</code> <code>{messageId}</code> <code>{bot}</code> <code>{botName}</code> <code>{botId}</code></p><p><b>Invite tracker:</b> <code>{inviter}</code> <code>{inviterName}</code> <code>{inviterId}</code> <code>{inviteCode}</code> <code>{inviteUses}</code></p><p><b>Legacy aliases:</b> <code>${userid}</code> <code>${username}</code> <code>${usertag}</code> <code>${usermention}</code> <code>${useravatarurl}</code> <code>${userserveravatarurl}</code> <code>${guildmembercount}</code> <code>${guildname}</code> <code>${guildid}</code> <code>${channelname}</code></p><p class="muted">In embed titles/descriptions, {user} and {mention} show the member's display name because Discord does not render mentions inside embeds. In normal message text, they create a real clickable mention.</p><button type="button" class="btn secondary copy-all-vars">Copy all variables</button></details><div class="discord-preview"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content">Your sticky message preview</div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div></div></div><button class="btn">Save sticky message</button></form><h3>📚 Saved Sticky Message List (<%= (cfg.sticky||[]).length %>)</h3><p class="muted">All sticky messages are listed below with their channel and trigger rule.</p><% (cfg.sticky||[]).forEach((st,i)=>{ %><div class="saved"><b>#<%=i+1%> · <%=st.embedTitle||st.content||'Sticky message'%></b> · <code><%=st.channelId%></code> · Trigger: <%=st.matchType==='everyMessage'?'Every message':(st.matchType||'contains')+' · '+(st.trigger||'not set')%><form method="post" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/sticky/<%=i%>/delete" style="display:inline"><button class="btn danger" type="submit">Delete</button></form></div><% }) %><p class="muted">You can save multiple sticky messages, including more than one in the same channel.</p></section><section class="card" id="sender"><h2>📨 Message Sender</h2><form method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="/dashboard/<%=guild.id%>/message-send"><label>Channel<select name="channelId" class="channel-select" required><option value="">Loading channels…</option></select></label><label>Message text<textarea name="content" maxlength="2000"></textarea></label><label>Embed title<input name="title" maxlength="256"></label><label>Embed description<textarea name="description" maxlength="4000"></textarea></label><label>Embed color<input type="color" name="color" value="#39ff14"></label><label>Upload image (PNG, JPG, GIF, WEBP · max 5 MB)<input type="file" name="imageFile" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/gif,image/webp"></label><label>Or image URL<input type="url" name="imageUrl" placeholder="https://.../image.png"></label><div class="discord-preview"><div class="preview-label">LIVE DISCORD PREVIEW</div><div class="preview-message"><b>Killora Bot</b><span class="preview-bot">APP</span><div class="preview-content"></div><div class="preview-embed" hidden><strong></strong><p></p><small>Killora Bot • Discord community bot</small></div></div></div><button class="btn">Send message</button></form></section></section></main><% if (typeof saved !== 'undefined' && saved) { %><div class="toast" role="status">✓ Settings saved successfully.</div><% } %><script>const guildId='<%=guild.id%>';const selectedResources=<%- JSON.stringify({welcome:cfg.welcome?.channelId||'',invite:cfg.inviteMessage?.channelId||'',leave:cfg.leave?.channelId||'',boost:cfg.boost?.channelId||'',ai:cfg.ai?.channelId||'',ticket:(cfg.ticketPanels||[]).slice(-1)[0]?.channelId||'',transcript:cfg.ticketTranscriptChannelId||cfg.logsChannelId||'',voice:cfg.joinToCreate?.channelId||'',category:cfg.joinToCreate?.categoryId||'',musicVoice:cfg.music?.voiceChannelId||'',musicText:cfg.music?.textChannelId||'',musicRole:cfg.music?.djRoleId||''}) %>;</script><script>document.querySelectorAll('.sticky-match-type').forEach(sel=>{const form=sel.closest('form'),input=form.querySelector('.sticky-trigger');const sync=()=>{const required=sel.value!=='everyMessage';input.required=required;input.disabled=!required;input.placeholder=required?'Enter the keyword that triggers this sticky':'Not needed for Every message';};sel.addEventListener('change',sync);sync();});</script><script src="/guild.js"></script><script>
// Dashboard modules behave like separate pages instead of one endless page.
const moduleLinks=[...document.querySelectorAll('#featureMenu a[href^="#"]')];
const moduleCards=[...document.querySelectorAll('.wrap .card[id]')];
function showModule(id){moduleCards.forEach(c=>c.hidden=c.id!==id);document.querySelectorAll('.wrap .grid').forEach(g=>{g.hidden=!g.querySelector('.card:not([hidden])')});const target=document.getElementById(id);if(target){target.hidden=false;target.closest('.grid')?.removeAttribute('hidden');history.replaceState(null,'','#'+id);}}
moduleLinks.forEach(a=>a.addEventListener('click',e=>{const id=a.getAttribute('href').slice(1);if(document.getElementById(id)){e.preventDefault();showModule(id);closeFeatureMenu();}}));
const initial=location.hash.slice(1);showModule(moduleCards.some(c=>c.id===initial)?initial:'welcome');
// Live Discord-style previews for every message/embed builder.
const previewConfigs=[
 ['#welcome form','content','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','useEmbed'],
 ['#leave form','content','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','useEmbed'],
 ['#boost form','content','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','useEmbed'],
 ['#invites form','content','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','useEmbed'],
 ['#sticky form','content','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','useEmbed'],
 ['#sender form','content','title','description','color',null],
 ['#autoresponder form','response','embedTitle','embedDescription','embedColor','embedEnabled'],
 ['#tickets form','', 'title','description','color',null]
];
function bindLivePreview(selector,contentName,titleName,descName,colorName,toggleName){
 const form=document.querySelector(selector);if(!form)return;
 const preview=form.querySelector('.discord-preview');if(!preview)return;
 const field=n=>n?form.querySelector(`[name="${n}"]`):null;
 const value=n=>field(n)?.value||'';
 const checked=n=>!!field(n)?.checked;
 const render=()=>{
  const ended=preview.querySelector('[data-boost-ended]');
  if(ended){const endedText=ended.querySelector('.preview-content');endedText.textContent=value('removeContent')||'A boost from {username} ended.';}
  const content=preview.querySelector('.preview-content');
  if(content)content.textContent=contentName?value(contentName):'';
  const embed=preview.querySelector('.preview-embed');
  if(embed){const title=embed.querySelector('strong'),desc=embed.querySelector('p');if(title)title.textContent=value(titleName);if(desc)desc.textContent=value(descName);embed.style.borderLeftColor=value(colorName)||'#39ff14';
   const isTicket=selector==='#tickets form';const use= isTicket || (toggleName?checked(toggleName):(!!value(titleName)||!!value(descName)));
   embed.hidden=!use || (!value(titleName)&&!value(descName));
   if(content)content.hidden=!content.textContent;
   const img=embed.querySelector('.preview-image');if(img){const url=value('imageUrl')||value('embedImage');img.src=url;img.hidden=!url;img.style.display=url?'block':'none';img.onerror=()=>{img.hidden=true;};}
  }
  if(ended){const endedText=ended.querySelector('.preview-content');endedText.hidden=!endedText.textContent;}
  const buttons=preview.querySelector('.preview-buttons');if(buttons){buttons.innerHTML='';form.querySelectorAll('#buttons input[name$="[label]"]').forEach(input=>{if(input.value.trim()){const b=document.createElement('span');b.className='preview-button';b.textContent=input.value;buttons.appendChild(b);}});}
 };
 form.addEventListener('input',render);form.addEventListener('change',render);
 if(selector==='#tickets form'){const list=form.querySelector('#buttons');if(list)new MutationObserver(render).observe(list,{childList:true,subtree:true});}
 render();
}
previewConfigs.forEach(args=>bindLivePreview(...args));
document.querySelectorAll('.copy-all-vars').forEach(btn=>btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{const box=btn.closest('.variables');const tokens=[...box.querySelectorAll('code')].map(el=>el.textContent);navigator.clipboard.writeText(tokens.join(' ')).then(()=>{btn.textContent='Copied all variables ✓';setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent='Copy all variables',1600);});}));
</script><script>const gid='<%=guild.id%>';const postJson=async(path,data)=>{const r=await fetch(path,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(data)});const j=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw Error(j.error||'Request failed');return j};document.getElementById('staffForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.target);await postJson('/api/guild/'+gid+'/staff-application',{enabled:f.has('enabled'),applyChannelId:f.get('applyChannelId'),approvedChannelId:f.get('approvedChannelId'),deniedChannelId:f.get('deniedChannelId'),categoryId:f.get('categoryId'),questions:f.get('questions')});alert('Staff application settings saved')};document.getElementById('securityForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const d={};e.target.querySelectorAll('input[type=checkbox]').forEach(x=>d[x.name]=x.checked);await postJson('/api/guild/'+gid+'/security',d);alert('Security settings saved')};const closeFeatureMenu=()=>{featureMenu.classList.remove('open');menuShade.classList.remove('open');document.body.classList.remove('menu-open')};document.getElementById('menuToggle').onclick=()=>{featureMenu.classList.add('open');menuShade.classList.add('open');document.body.classList.add('menu-open')};document.getElementById('menuClose').onclick=()=>{closeFeatureMenu()};menuShade.onclick=closeFeatureMenu;featureMenu.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a=>a.onclick=closeFeatureMenu);window.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{if(featureMenu.classList.contains('open'))closeFeatureMenu()},{passive:true});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape')closeFeatureMenu()});document.getElementById('previewEmbed').onclick=async()=>{const j=await postJson('/api/guild/'+gid+'/embed-preview',{title:embedTitle.value,description:embedDescription.value,color:embedColor.value});embedOutput.textContent=JSON.stringify(j.embed,null,2)};fetch('/api/guild/'+gid+'/plugins').then(r=>r.json()).then(a=>pluginList.innerHTML=a.map(p=>'<div class="saved"><b>'+String(p.name||p.id).replace(/[<>]/g,'')+'</b> · '+(p.enabled?'Enabled':'Disabled')+' · '+(p.description||'')+'</div>').join('')||'No local plugins installed').catch(()=>pluginList.textContent='Unable to load plugins');</script></body></html>
